      },
      "questionNumber": "01",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "$\\partial.\\DeltaA=[\\begin{matrix}1 & 2 & -3\\\\ -2 & 1 & 0\\end{matrix}],B=[\\begin{matrix}-1 & 2\\\\ -3 & 7\\\\ 5 & 0\\end{matrix}],C=[\\begin{matrix}5 & 1\\\\ 1 & -3\\end{matrix}]$\n$D=[\\begin{matrix}1 & 1 & -1\\\\ 0 & -2 & 2\\\\ 1 & 2 & 3\\end{matrix}]$",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$x$ এর যেসব মানের জন্য $[\\begin{matrix}{x}^{2} & 2x\\\\ 5 & 3\\end{matrix}]$ ম্যাট্রিক্স ব্যতিক্রমী হবে তা নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$[\\begin{matrix}{x}^{2} & 2x\\\\ 5 & 3\\end{matrix}]$ ম্যাট্রিক্সটি ব্যতিক্রমী হলে, $|\\begin{matrix}{x}^{2} & 2x\\\\ 5 & 3\\end{matrix}|=0$\nবা, $3{x}^{2}-10x=0$ বা, $x(3x-10)=0$\n$∴x=0,\\frac{10}{3}$ (Ans.)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$AB-{C}^{2}+2{I}_{2}$ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $A=[\\begin{matrix}1 & 2 & -3\\\\ -2 & 1 & 0\\end{matrix}],B=[\\begin{matrix}-1 & 2\\\\ -3 & 7\\\\ 5 & 0\\end{matrix}]$\n$AB=[\\begin{matrix}1 & 2 & -3\\\\ -2 & 1 & 0\\end{matrix}][\\begin{matrix}-1 & 2\\\\ -3 & 7\\\\ 5 & 0\\end{matrix}]$\n$=[\\begin{matrix}-1-6-15 & 2+14-0\\\\ 2-3+0 & -4+7+0\\end{matrix}]=[\\begin{matrix}-22 & 16\\\\ -1 & 3\\end{matrix}]$\n${C}^{2}=C\\cdotC=[\\begin{matrix}5 & 1\\\\ 1 & -3\\end{matrix}][\\begin{matrix}5 & 1\\\\ 1 & -3\\end{matrix}]=[\\begin{matrix}25+1 & 5-3\\\\ 5-3 & 1+9\\end{matrix}]=[\\begin{matrix}26 & 2\\\\ 2 & 10\\end{matrix}]$\n$∴$ প্রদত্ত রাশি $=AB-{C}^{2}+2{I}_{2}$\n$=[\\begin{matrix}-22 & 16\\\\ -1 & 3\\end{matrix}]-[\\begin{matrix}26 & 2\\\\ 2 & 10\\end{matrix}]+[\\begin{matrix}2 & 0\\\\ 0 & 2\\end{matrix}]$\n$=[\\begin{matrix}-22-26+2 & 16-2+0\\\\ -1-2+0 & 3-10+2\\end{matrix}]=[\\begin{matrix}-46 & 14\\\\ -3 & -5\\end{matrix}]$\n(Ans.)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "${D}^{-1}$ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$|D|=|\\begin{matrix}1 & 1 & -1\\\\ 0 & -2 & 2\\\\ 1 & 2 & 3\\end{matrix}|=1(-6-4)-1(0-2)+(-1)(0+2)$\n$=-10+2-2=-10\\neq0$\n$∴{D}^{-1}$ নির্ণয়যোগ্য।\n$∴adjD={[\\begin{matrix}|\\begin{matrix}-2 & 2\\\\ 2 & 3\\end{matrix}| & -|\\begin{matrix}0 & 2\\\\ 1 & 3\\end{matrix}| & |\\begin{matrix}0 & -2\\\\ 1 & 2\\end{matrix}|\\\\ -|\\begin{matrix}1 & -1\\\\ 2 & 3\\end{matrix}| & |\\begin{matrix}1 & -1\\\\ 1 & 3\\end{matrix}| & -|\\begin{matrix}1 & 1\\\\ 1 & 2\\end{matrix}|\\\\ |\\begin{matrix}1 & -1\\\\ -2 & 2\\end{matrix}| & -|\\begin{matrix}1 & -1\\\\ 0 & 2\\end{matrix}| & |\\begin{matrix}1 & 1\\\\ 0 & -2\\end{matrix}|\\end{matrix}]}^{t}$\n$={[\\begin{matrix}-10 & 2 & 2\\\\ -5 & 4 & -1\\\\ 0 & -2 & -2\\end{matrix}]}^{t}=[\\begin{matrix}-10 & -5 & 0\\\\ 2 & 4 & -2\\\\ 2 & -1 & -2\\end{matrix}]$\n$∴{D}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{|D|}$ adj $D=\\frac{1}{-10}[\\begin{matrix}-10 & -5 & 0\\\\ 2 & 4 & -2\\\\ 2 & -1 & -2\\end{matrix}]$\n$=\\frac{1}{10}[\\begin{matrix}10 & 5 & 0\\\\ -2 & -4 & 2\\\\ -2 & 1 & 2\\end{matrix}]$ (Ans.)"
          }
        }
      ],
