    {
      "clientId": "comilla-2017-math1st-cq06",
      "curriculum": {
        "path": "hsc/math/1st/chapter-7"
      },
      "questionNumber": "06",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "দৃশ্যকল্প-১: $\\sinx+\\siny=a$ এবং $\\cosx+\\cosy=b$ দুইটি ত্রিকোণমিতিক সমীকরণ।\nদৃশ্যকল্প-২ : $△ABC$ এর $A+B+C=\\pi$",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "যদি $△PQR$ এর তিনটি বাহুর দৈর্ঘ্য যথাক্রমে $p,q,r$ এবং ${p}^{2}+{q}^{2}-{r}^{2}=\\sqrt{2}pq$ হয়, তবে $R$ কোণের মান নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, ${p}^{2}+{q}^{2}-{r}^{2}=\\sqrt{2}pq$\nবা, $\\frac{{p}^{2}+{q}^{2}-{r}^{2}}{2pq}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}pq}{2pq}$\nবা, $\\cosR=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$\nবা, $\\cosR=\\cos{45}^{\\circ}$\n$∴R={45}^{\\circ}$ (Ans.)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দৃশ্যকল্প : ১ এর আলোকে $\\cos(x+y)$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $\\sinx+\\siny=a$\nবা, $2\\sin\\frac{x+y}{2}\\cos\\frac{x-y}{2}=a$ ..... (i)\nএবং $\\cosx+\\cosy=b$\nবা, $2\\cos\\frac{x+y}{2}\\cos\\frac{x-y}{2}=b$ ...... (ii)\n(i) $\\div$ (ii) করে পাই, $\\tan\\frac{x+y}{2}=\\frac{a}{b}$\nবা, ${\\tan}^{2}\\frac{x+y}{2}=\\frac{{a}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}$ বা, ${\\sec}^{2}\\frac{x+y}{2}-1=\\frac{{a}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}$\nবা, ${\\sec}^{2}\\frac{x+y}{2}=1+\\frac{{a}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}$ বা, ${\\sec}^{2}\\frac{x+y}{2}=\\frac{{a}^{2}+{b}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}$\nবা, ${\\cos}^{2}\\frac{x+y}{2}=\\frac{{b}^{2}}{{a}^{2}+{b}^{2}}$\nবা, $2{\\cos}^{2}\\frac{x+y}{2}=\\frac{2{\\text{ }b}^{2}}{{a}^{2}+{b}^{2}}$\nবা, $1+\\cos(x+y)=\\frac{2{b}^{2}}{{a}^{2}+{b}^{2}}$\nবা, $\\cos(x+y)=\\frac{2{\\text{ }b}^{2}}{{a}^{2}+{b}^{2}}-1=\\frac{2{\\text{ }b}^{2}-{a}^{2}-{b}^{2}}{{a}^{2}+{b}^{2}}$\n$∴\\cos(x+y)=\\frac{{b}^{2}-{a}^{2}}{{\\text{ }b}^{2}+{a}^{2}}$ (Ans.)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দৃশ্যকল্প : ২ হতে প্রমাণ কর যে, \n${\\sin}^{2}\\text{ }A-{\\sin}^{2}\\text{ }B+{\\sin}^{2}C=2\\sinA\\cosB\\sinC$"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "এখানে, $△ABC\\Omega,A+B+C=\\pi$\nবামপক্ষ $={\\sin}^{2}\\text{ }A-{\\sin}^{2}\\text{ }B+{\\sin}^{2}C$\n$=(\\sinA+\\sinB)(\\sinA-\\sinB)+{\\sin}^{2}C$\n$=(2\\sin\\frac{A+B}{2}\\cos\\frac{A-B}{2})\\cdot(2\\cos\\frac{A+B}{2}\\sin\\frac{A-B}{2})+{\\sin}^{2}C$\n$=(2\\sin\\frac{A+B}{2}\\cos\\frac{A+B}{2})\\cdot(2\\sin\\frac{A-B}{2}\\cos\\frac{A-B}{2})+{\\sin}^{2}C$\n$=\\sin(A+B)\\sin(A-B)+{\\sin}^{2}C$\n$=\\sin(\\pi-C)\\sin(A-B)+{\\sin}^{2}C[∵A+B+C=\\pi]$\n$=\\sinC\\sin(A-B)+{\\sin}^{2}C$\n$=\\sinC\\{\\sin(A-B)+\\sinC\\}$\n$=\\sinC[\\sin(A-B)+\\sin\\{\\pi-(A+B)\\}][∵A+B+C=\\pi]$\n$=\\sinC\\{\\sin(A-B)+\\sin(A+B)\\}$\n$=\\sinC\\cdot2\\sinA\\cosB$\n$=2\\sinA\\cosB\\sinC=$ ডানপক্ষ\n$∴{\\sin}^{2}\\text{ }A-{\\sin}^{2}\\text{ }B+{\\sin}^{2}C=2\\sinA\\cosB\\sinC$ (প্রমাণিত)"
          }
        }
      ],
