      "questionNumber": "07",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "$y=4x(6-x{)}^{2}$ এবং $f(x)={e}^{{\\tan}^{-1}x}$",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}\\frac{1-\\cos2x}{x}$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}\\frac{1-\\cos2x}{x}=\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}\\frac{2{\\sin}^{2}x}{x}$\n$=2\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}x\\cdot\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}{(\\frac{\\sinx}{x})}^{2}$\n$=2.0{.1}^{2}=0\\text{ (Ans.) }$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$y$ -এর গরিষ্ঠ মান নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $y=4x(6-x{)}^{2}=4x(36-12x+{x}^{2})$\n$=144x-48{x}^{2}+4{x}^{3}$\n$∴\\frac{dy}{dx}=144-96x+12{x}^{2}$\n$∴\\frac{{d}^{2}y}{d{x}^{2}}=-96+24x$\nলঘুমান ও গুরুমান এর জন্য, $\\frac{dy}{dx}=0$\nবা, $144-96x+12{x}^{2}=0$\nবা, ${x}^{2}-8x+12=0$\nবা, ${x}^{2}-6x-2x+12=0$\nবা, $(x-6)(x-2)=0$\n$∴x=6,2$\nx = 2 হলে, $\\frac{{d}^{2}y}{{dx}^{2}}=-96+24\\times2=-48<0$\n$x=2$ এর জন্য প্রদত্ত ফাংশনটির গরিষ্ঠ মান বিদ্যমান।\n$∴$ গরিষ্ঠ মান $=4\\times2\\times(6-2{)}^{2}$\n$=8\\times16=128\\text{ (Ans.) }$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "প্রমাণ কর যে, $(1+{x}^{2}){f}^{′′}(x)+(2x-1){f}^{′}(x)=0$"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "ধরি, $y=f(x)={e}^{{\\tan}^{-1}x}$\nবা, $\\lny=\\ln{e}^{{\\tan}^{-1}x}$ [উভয়পক্ষে $\\ln$ নিয়ে]\nবা, $\\lny={\\tan}^{-1}x [∵\\lne=1]$\nবা, $\\frac{d}{dx}(\\lny)=\\frac{d}{dx}({\\tan}^{-1}x)$\nবা, $\\frac{1}{y}\\cdot{y}_{1}=\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}$\nবা, ${y}_{1}(1+{x}^{2})=y$\nবা, $\\frac{d}{dx}\\{{y}_{1}(1+{x}^{2})\\}=\\frac{d}{dx}(y)$\nবা, $(1+{x}^{2}){y}_{2}+2x{y}_{1}={y}_{1}$\nবা, $(1+{x}^{2}){y}_{2}+(2x-1){y}_{1}=0$\n$∴(1+{x}^{2}){f}^{′′}(x)+(2x-1){f}^{′}(x)=0$ (প্রমাণিত)"
          }
        }
      ],
