      "questionNumber": "08",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "$u={e}^{x}\\text{ এবং }4{x}^{2}+9{y}^{2}=36$",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দেখাও যে, $\\int\\lnxdx=x\\lnx-x+C$"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\begin{matrix}\\int\\lnx & dx=\\lnx\\intdx-\\int\\{\\frac{d}{dx}(\\lnx)\\intdx\\}dx\\\\ = & x\\lnx-\\int\\frac{1}{x}\\cdotxdx=x\\lnx-\\intdx\\\\ =x\\lnx-x+c\\text{ (দেখানো হলো })\\end{matrix}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "${\\int}_{0}^{\\ln2}\\frac{u}{1+u}dx$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "ধরি, $z=1+{e}^{x}$\n$∴dz={e}^{x}dx$\n[IMG_0]\nদেওয়া আছে, u = ex\n$∴{\\int}_{0}^{\\ln2}\\frac{u}{1+u}dx$\n$={\\int}_{0}^{\\ln2}\\frac{{e}^{x}}{1+{e}^{x}}dx$\n$={\\int}_{2}^{3}\\frac{1}{z}dz=[\\lnz{]}_{2}^{3}$\n$=\\ln3-\\ln2=\\ln\\frac{3}{2}$ (Ans)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "যোগজীকরণের সাহায্যে প্রদত্ত উপবৃত্তের ক্ষেত্রফল নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "[IMG_0]\nপ্রদত্ত উপবৃত্তের সমীকরণ,\n$4{x}^{2}+9{y}^{2}=36$ বা, $9{y}^{2}=36-4{x}^{2}$\nবা, ${y}^{2}=\\frac{4}{9}(9-{x}^{2})∴y=\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}}$\nউপবৃত্তটি দ্বারা আবদ্ধ ক্ষেত্রের ক্ষেত্রেল\n$=4{\\int}_{0}^{3}ydx=4{\\int}_{0}^{3}\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}}dx$\n$=\\frac{8}{3}{\\int}_{0}^{3}\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}}dx$\n$x=3\\sin\\theta$ হলে, $dx=3\\cos\\thetad\\theta$\nসীমা: $x=0$ হলে, $\\theta=0$\nএবং $x=3$ হলে, $\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\n$∴$ উপবৃত্তটির ক্ষের্রফল $=\\frac{8}{3}{\\int}_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\sqrt{9-9{\\sin}^{2}\\theta}\\cdot3\\cos\\thetad\\theta$\n$=\\frac{8}{3}{\\int}_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\sqrt{9(1-{\\sin}^{2}\\theta)}\\cdot3\\cos\\thetad\\theta$\n$=8{\\int}_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\sqrt{9{\\cos}^{2}\\theta}\\cdot\\cos\\thetad\\theta$\n$=8{\\int}_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}3\\cos\\theta\\times\\cos\\thetad\\theta$\n$=12{\\int}_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}2{\\cos}^{2}\\thetad\\theta$\n$=12{\\int}_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}(1+\\cos2\\theta)d\\theta$\n$=12{[\\theta+\\frac{1}{2}\\sin2\\theta]}_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}$\n$=12(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\sin\\pi)$\n$=6\\pi$ বর্গ একক। (Ans.)"
          }
        }
      ],
